[
  {
    "start": "00:00:03.900",
    "end": "00:00:06.420",
    "start_seconds": 3.9,
    "end_seconds": 6.42,
    "text": "Last July I was in Rome."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:07.620",
    "end": "00:00:11.540",
    "start_seconds": 7.62,
    "end_seconds": 11.54,
    "text": "I walked from my hotel to the Trevi Fountain"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:11.580",
    "end": "00:00:16.260",
    "start_seconds": 11.58,
    "end_seconds": 16.26,
    "text": "on the cobbled streets lined with beautiful cafes,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:16.300",
    "end": "00:00:19.780",
    "start_seconds": 16.3,
    "end_seconds": 19.78,
    "text": "bustling with residents and travelers,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:19.780",
    "end": "00:00:23.140",
    "start_seconds": 19.78,
    "end_seconds": 23.14,
    "text": "drinking their espressos and cheering and greeting each other."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:24.060",
    "end": "00:00:29.340",
    "start_seconds": 24.06,
    "end_seconds": 29.34,
    "text": "Small souvenir shops selling beautiful replicas of the Colosseum,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.380",
    "end": "00:00:32.420",
    "start_seconds": 29.38,
    "end_seconds": 32.42,
    "text": "the Sistine Chapel ceiling paintings."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:32.460",
    "end": "00:00:33.700",
    "start_seconds": 32.46,
    "end_seconds": 33.7,
    "text": "What an atmosphere."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:34.900",
    "end": "00:00:37.300",
    "start_seconds": 34.9,
    "end_seconds": 37.3,
    "text": "I soaked it all in,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:37.340",
    "end": "00:00:39.500",
    "start_seconds": 37.34,
    "end_seconds": 39.5,
    "text": "reached the Trevi Fountain,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:39.540",
    "end": "00:00:43.460",
    "start_seconds": 39.54,
    "end_seconds": 43.46,
    "text": "grabbed my favorite pistachio gelato"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:43.500",
    "end": "00:00:46.060",
    "start_seconds": 43.5,
    "end_seconds": 46.06,
    "text": "and looked at the marvelous views."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.100",
    "end": "00:00:48.660",
    "start_seconds": 46.1,
    "end_seconds": 48.66,
    "text": "A perfect Roman holiday."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:49.900",
    "end": "00:00:52.380",
    "start_seconds": 49.9,
    "end_seconds": 52.38,
    "text": "Suddenly my alarm rang"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:52.420",
    "end": "00:00:54.420",
    "start_seconds": 52.42,
    "end_seconds": 54.42,
    "text": "and I woke up from my dream."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:56.500",
    "end": "00:00:57.740",
    "start_seconds": 56.5,
    "end_seconds": 57.74,
    "text": "I was in Rome."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.540",
    "end": "00:01:01.580",
    "start_seconds": 58.54,
    "end_seconds": 61.58,
    "text": "I did walk from my hotel to the Trevi Fountain."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:03.380",
    "end": "00:01:04.700",
    "start_seconds": 63.38,
    "end_seconds": 64.7,
    "text": "But I felt rushed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:07.020",
    "end": "00:01:09.140",
    "start_seconds": 67.02,
    "end_seconds": 69.14,
    "text": "The cafes were crowded."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:10.020",
    "end": "00:01:12.020",
    "start_seconds": 70.02,
    "end_seconds": 72.02,
    "text": "People had to even queue outside."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:13.060",
    "end": "00:01:16.020",
    "start_seconds": 73.06,
    "end_seconds": 76.02,
    "text": "The shopkeepers had no time to entertain visitors."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:16.900",
    "end": "00:01:19.340",
    "start_seconds": 76.9,
    "end_seconds": 79.34,
    "text": "I reached the Trevi Fountain"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.380",
    "end": "00:01:23.380",
    "start_seconds": 79.38,
    "end_seconds": 83.38,
    "text": "and forgot [to] grab my favorite pistachio gelato"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:23.420",
    "end": "00:01:25.260",
    "start_seconds": 83.42,
    "end_seconds": 85.26,
    "text": "or find a bench to sit."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:26.460",
    "end": "00:01:28.260",
    "start_seconds": 86.46000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 88.26,
    "text": "I couldn't get to the steps."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:28.660",
    "end": "00:01:32.860",
    "start_seconds": 88.66,
    "end_seconds": 92.86,
    "text": "Thousands and thousands of people all around."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:33.660",
    "end": "00:01:35.300",
    "start_seconds": 93.66,
    "end_seconds": 95.3,
    "text": "Have you felt the same way?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:36.340",
    "end": "00:01:39.420",
    "start_seconds": 96.34,
    "end_seconds": 99.42,
    "text": "When you reach your dream destination,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:39.460",
    "end": "00:01:42.500",
    "start_seconds": 99.46000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 102.5,
    "text": "you feel as if it has been overrun."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:42.540",
    "end": "00:01:45.860",
    "start_seconds": 102.53999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 105.86,
    "text": "You feel as if it has become a selfie queue."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:45.860",
    "end": "00:01:48.020",
    "start_seconds": 105.86,
    "end_seconds": 108.02000000000001,
    "text": "I had the same feeling."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:48.060",
    "end": "00:01:49.900",
    "start_seconds": 108.06,
    "end_seconds": 109.9,
    "text": "And this is not an isolated incident."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:51.340",
    "end": "00:01:54.500",
    "start_seconds": 111.34,
    "end_seconds": 114.5,
    "text": "I had the same exact experience in Tokyo"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:54.540",
    "end": "00:01:57.620",
    "start_seconds": 114.53999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 117.62,
    "text": "when I went there during the cherry blossom season."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:58.260",
    "end": "00:02:03.180",
    "start_seconds": 118.25999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 123.18,
    "text": "Tourists crowd every park in the city"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.220",
    "end": "00:02:05.060",
    "start_seconds": 123.22,
    "end_seconds": 125.06,
    "text": "to get a glimpse of the famous sakura."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:07.140",
    "end": "00:02:11.940",
    "start_seconds": 127.14,
    "end_seconds": 131.94,
    "text": "I asked a resident: “How does [you] feel seeing so many tourists all around?”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:13.500",
    "end": "00:02:17.260",
    "start_seconds": 133.5,
    "end_seconds": 137.26,
    "text": "He told me that he doesn't bring his family anymore"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:17.300",
    "end": "00:02:18.940",
    "start_seconds": 137.3,
    "end_seconds": 138.94,
    "text": "for a picnic under the sakura."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:20.180",
    "end": "00:02:22.300",
    "start_seconds": 140.18,
    "end_seconds": 142.3,
    "text": "That response broke my heart."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:23.780",
    "end": "00:02:27.780",
    "start_seconds": 143.78,
    "end_seconds": 147.78,
    "text": "We are loving our favorite destinations to death."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:29.220",
    "end": "00:02:30.660",
    "start_seconds": 149.22,
    "end_seconds": 150.66,
    "text": "We are overrunning them."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:32.620",
    "end": "00:02:34.740",
    "start_seconds": 152.62,
    "end_seconds": 154.74,
    "text": "And residents are pushing back"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:34.740",
    "end": "00:02:36.860",
    "start_seconds": 154.74,
    "end_seconds": 156.86,
    "text": "because it's impacting their livability."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:37.860",
    "end": "00:02:41.220",
    "start_seconds": 157.86,
    "end_seconds": 161.22,
    "text": "Their cost of living is increasing, congestion on the road,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:41.260",
    "end": "00:02:44.420",
    "start_seconds": 161.26,
    "end_seconds": 164.42000000000002,
    "text": "rental prices, food prices."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:44.460",
    "end": "00:02:45.940",
    "start_seconds": 164.46,
    "end_seconds": 165.94,
    "text": "They are pushing back."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:45.940",
    "end": "00:02:48.820",
    "start_seconds": 165.94,
    "end_seconds": 168.82,
    "text": "And they're pushing back like in Barcelona,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:48.820",
    "end": "00:02:51.260",
    "start_seconds": 168.82,
    "end_seconds": 171.26,
    "text": "with the graffiti asking tourists to go home."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:52.500",
    "end": "00:02:55.420",
    "start_seconds": 172.5,
    "end_seconds": 175.42000000000002,
    "text": "In Barcelona, in Italy, in Portugal,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:56.740",
    "end": "00:02:58.660",
    "start_seconds": 176.74,
    "end_seconds": 178.66,
    "text": "residents are pushing back."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:59.900",
    "end": "00:03:02.100",
    "start_seconds": 179.9,
    "end_seconds": 182.1,
    "text": "I have been researching the travel industry"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:02.100",
    "end": "00:03:03.700",
    "start_seconds": 182.1,
    "end_seconds": 183.7,
    "text": "for [the] last 20 years"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:03.700",
    "end": "00:03:08.380",
    "start_seconds": 183.7,
    "end_seconds": 188.38,
    "text": "and my two research subjects, the residents and the travelers,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:08.420",
    "end": "00:03:11.180",
    "start_seconds": 188.42,
    "end_seconds": 191.18,
    "text": "are on a collision course like never before."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:12.260",
    "end": "00:03:15.060",
    "start_seconds": 192.26,
    "end_seconds": 195.06,
    "text": "We have a travel crisis."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:15.820",
    "end": "00:03:20.940",
    "start_seconds": 195.82,
    "end_seconds": 200.94,
    "text": "The travel industry employs about 300 million people globally,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:20.940",
    "end": "00:03:25.180",
    "start_seconds": 200.94,
    "end_seconds": 205.18,
    "text": "and it’s going to be a $15 trillion industry by 2040."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.780",
    "end": "00:03:27.740",
    "start_seconds": 205.78,
    "end_seconds": 207.74,
    "text": "[It’s] too large, [with] too many"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:27.740",
    "end": "00:03:30.140",
    "start_seconds": 207.74,
    "end_seconds": 210.14,
    "text": "livelihoods at stake for us to ignore this crisis."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:31.300",
    "end": "00:03:33.660",
    "start_seconds": 211.3,
    "end_seconds": 213.66,
    "text": "But let me pause and ask you a question."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.580",
    "end": "00:03:36.660",
    "start_seconds": 214.57999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 216.66,
    "text": "Why do we travel?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:36.660",
    "end": "00:03:38.820",
    "start_seconds": 216.66,
    "end_seconds": 218.82,
    "text": "We travel for joy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.500",
    "end": "00:03:44.660",
    "start_seconds": 219.5,
    "end_seconds": 224.66,
    "text": "Joy by experiencing the diversity this world has to offer."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.660",
    "end": "00:03:47.340",
    "start_seconds": 224.66,
    "end_seconds": 227.34,
    "text": "Joy by experiencing different lives."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:47.380",
    "end": "00:03:49.220",
    "start_seconds": 227.38,
    "end_seconds": 229.22,
    "text": "Joy through a shared connection."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.100",
    "end": "00:03:53.100",
    "start_seconds": 230.1,
    "end_seconds": 233.1,
    "text": "My daughter, son and wife are here,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:53.140",
    "end": "00:03:57.700",
    "start_seconds": 233.14,
    "end_seconds": 237.7,
    "text": "and I want them to experience the same joy I experienced in my Roman dream."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:57.700",
    "end": "00:04:00.580",
    "start_seconds": 237.7,
    "end_seconds": 240.58,
    "text": "I want all of you to experience the same joy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:01.540",
    "end": "00:04:04.780",
    "start_seconds": 241.54,
    "end_seconds": 244.78,
    "text": "We need to bring joy back in travel."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.260",
    "end": "00:04:08.220",
    "start_seconds": 246.26,
    "end_seconds": 248.22,
    "text": "But it's a complex problem."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:08.260",
    "end": "00:04:13.180",
    "start_seconds": 248.26,
    "end_seconds": 253.18,
    "text": "We have millions of tourists getting inspired by social media"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:13.220",
    "end": "00:04:16.900",
    "start_seconds": 253.22,
    "end_seconds": 256.9,
    "text": "and planning their travel destinations, and planning their travel itineraries."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:16.900",
    "end": "00:04:20.820",
    "start_seconds": 256.9,
    "end_seconds": 260.82,
    "text": "We have the travel industry, which is looking for short-term profits,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:20.820",
    "end": "00:04:24.580",
    "start_seconds": 260.82,
    "end_seconds": 264.58,
    "text": "and we have cities who don't know how to manage the tourist inflow."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:25.780",
    "end": "00:04:28.460",
    "start_seconds": 265.78,
    "end_seconds": 268.46,
    "text": "There is a path forward, though."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:28.500",
    "end": "00:04:33.820",
    "start_seconds": 268.5,
    "end_seconds": 273.82,
    "text": "With the use of technology like AI and simple behavior changes,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:33.820",
    "end": "00:04:37.020",
    "start_seconds": 273.82,
    "end_seconds": 277.02,
    "text": "we could bring joy back in travel."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:37.860",
    "end": "00:04:43.060",
    "start_seconds": 277.86,
    "end_seconds": 283.06,
    "text": "Now imagine if we were to make the entire travel industry's objective,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:43.100",
    "end": "00:04:45.900",
    "start_seconds": 283.1,
    "end_seconds": 285.9,
    "text": "the airlines, the hotel, the travel tour operators,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:45.900",
    "end": "00:04:51.780",
    "start_seconds": 285.9,
    "end_seconds": 291.78,
    "text": "to bring joy to both residents as well as the travelers."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:51.780",
    "end": "00:04:53.900",
    "start_seconds": 291.78,
    "end_seconds": 293.9,
    "text": "And they have everything at their disposal,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:53.900",
    "end": "00:04:56.540",
    "start_seconds": 293.9,
    "end_seconds": 296.54,
    "text": "from technology to people to skilling."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:56.580",
    "end": "00:04:58.660",
    "start_seconds": 296.58,
    "end_seconds": 298.65999999999997,
    "text": "They will rise to the occasion."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:58.660",
    "end": "00:04:59.980",
    "start_seconds": 298.65999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 299.98,
    "text": "They will do three things:"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:00.020",
    "end": "00:05:03.020",
    "start_seconds": 300.02,
    "end_seconds": 303.02,
    "text": "one, help manage crowd,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:03.060",
    "end": "00:05:05.660",
    "start_seconds": 303.06,
    "end_seconds": 305.66,
    "text": "help discover authentic experiences"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:05.660",
    "end": "00:05:09.100",
    "start_seconds": 305.66,
    "end_seconds": 309.1,
    "text": "and help drive a really, really respectful connection"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:09.140",
    "end": "00:05:12.380",
    "start_seconds": 309.14,
    "end_seconds": 312.38,
    "text": "between the resident and the traveler."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:12.420",
    "end": "00:05:13.660",
    "start_seconds": 312.42,
    "end_seconds": 313.66,
    "text": "On your last trip,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:15.340",
    "end": "00:05:17.540",
    "start_seconds": 315.34,
    "end_seconds": 317.54,
    "text": "did you feel rushed?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:17.580",
    "end": "00:05:20.140",
    "start_seconds": 317.58,
    "end_seconds": 320.14,
    "text": "Did you feel like you were going through a checklist,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:20.180",
    "end": "00:05:22.620",
    "start_seconds": 320.18,
    "end_seconds": 322.62,
    "text": "moving from one place to another place?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:22.620",
    "end": "00:05:25.620",
    "start_seconds": 322.62,
    "end_seconds": 325.62,
    "text": "Did it feel like a chore or did you feel joy?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:27.260",
    "end": "00:05:28.540",
    "start_seconds": 327.26,
    "end_seconds": 328.54,
    "text": "We all are super busy"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:30.100",
    "end": "00:05:32.540",
    "start_seconds": 330.1,
    "end_seconds": 332.54,
    "text": "and we all land to the same destinations"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:32.580",
    "end": "00:05:34.740",
    "start_seconds": 332.58,
    "end_seconds": 334.74,
    "text": "during the same peak season times"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:36.020",
    "end": "00:05:38.820",
    "start_seconds": 336.02,
    "end_seconds": 338.82,
    "text": "without realizing quieter seasons,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:38.820",
    "end": "00:05:41.500",
    "start_seconds": 338.82,
    "end_seconds": 341.5,
    "text": "quieter times, or hidden paths."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:41.540",
    "end": "00:05:43.940",
    "start_seconds": 341.54,
    "end_seconds": 343.94,
    "text": "What if technology could help us figure that out?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:45.140",
    "end": "00:05:48.460",
    "start_seconds": 345.14,
    "end_seconds": 348.46,
    "text": "FeelFlorence is an app by the city of Florence,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:48.500",
    "end": "00:05:52.180",
    "start_seconds": 348.5,
    "end_seconds": 352.18,
    "text": "which helps do exactly this for the travelers."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:53.260",
    "end": "00:05:58.060",
    "start_seconds": 353.26,
    "end_seconds": 358.06,
    "text": "It uses the data from sensors, from cameras,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:58.100",
    "end": "00:06:00.900",
    "start_seconds": 358.1,
    "end_seconds": 360.9,
    "text": "to understand crowded locations,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:00.900",
    "end": "00:06:05.220",
    "start_seconds": 360.9,
    "end_seconds": 365.22,
    "text": "and recommends personalized travel itineraries for tourists."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:05.260",
    "end": "00:06:08.740",
    "start_seconds": 365.26,
    "end_seconds": 368.74,
    "text": "It sends user alerts to avoid crowded locations."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:08.740",
    "end": "00:06:10.020",
    "start_seconds": 368.74,
    "end_seconds": 370.02,
    "text": "When this happens,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:10.860",
    "end": "00:06:13.020",
    "start_seconds": 370.86,
    "end_seconds": 373.02,
    "text": "it balances the load,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:13.060",
    "end": "00:06:16.340",
    "start_seconds": 373.06,
    "end_seconds": 376.34,
    "text": "and it is beneficial for both the tourists,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:16.380",
    "end": "00:06:18.100",
    "start_seconds": 376.38,
    "end_seconds": 378.1,
    "text": "as well as the residents."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:19.020",
    "end": "00:06:20.580",
    "start_seconds": 379.02,
    "end_seconds": 380.58,
    "text": "Cities are going down that path."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:20.580",
    "end": "00:06:21.860",
    "start_seconds": 380.58,
    "end_seconds": 381.86,
    "text": "Amsterdam."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:21.860",
    "end": "00:06:24.740",
    "start_seconds": 381.86,
    "end_seconds": 384.74,
    "text": "And even religious cities like Mecca or Varanasi"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:24.740",
    "end": "00:06:28.180",
    "start_seconds": 384.74,
    "end_seconds": 388.18,
    "text": "are increasingly using technology to manage crowd."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:29.780",
    "end": "00:06:33.780",
    "start_seconds": 389.78,
    "end_seconds": 393.78,
    "text": "What was your last unforgettable trip?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:34.580",
    "end": "00:06:39.620",
    "start_seconds": 394.58,
    "end_seconds": 399.62,
    "text": "Was it the famous landmark, [the] Instagrammable picture,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:39.620",
    "end": "00:06:41.780",
    "start_seconds": 399.62,
    "end_seconds": 401.78,
    "text": "or was it a shared smile with someone?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:43.300",
    "end": "00:06:45.300",
    "start_seconds": 403.3,
    "end_seconds": 405.3,
    "text": "Or was it a story that somebody told you,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:45.340",
    "end": "00:06:46.660",
    "start_seconds": 405.34000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 406.65999999999997,
    "text": "of course, in the backdrop"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:46.660",
    "end": "00:06:49.700",
    "start_seconds": 406.65999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 409.7,
    "text": "of beautiful nature or a beautiful surrounding."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:50.900",
    "end": "00:06:52.820",
    "start_seconds": 410.9,
    "end_seconds": 412.82,
    "text": "I asked the same question to my friend."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:54.660",
    "end": "00:06:58.260",
    "start_seconds": 414.65999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 418.26,
    "text": "She said, \"If I ignore my bachelorette party outside,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:59.940",
    "end": "00:07:02.900",
    "start_seconds": 419.94,
    "end_seconds": 422.9,
    "text": "my last unforgettable trip was in Vietnam."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:04.580",
    "end": "00:07:07.300",
    "start_seconds": 424.58,
    "end_seconds": 427.3,
    "text": "A fisherman took me on a boat ride,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:08.340",
    "end": "00:07:10.220",
    "start_seconds": 428.34,
    "end_seconds": 430.22,
    "text": "told me stories about Vietnam,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:10.260",
    "end": "00:07:13.820",
    "start_seconds": 430.26,
    "end_seconds": 433.82,
    "text": "told me stories about the life he has lived there."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:13.820",
    "end": "00:07:15.980",
    "start_seconds": 433.82,
    "end_seconds": 435.98,
    "text": "And I cannot forget that.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:16.020",
    "end": "00:07:17.380",
    "start_seconds": 436.02,
    "end_seconds": 437.38,
    "text": "What a beautiful connection."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:18.860",
    "end": "00:07:20.140",
    "start_seconds": 438.86,
    "end_seconds": 440.14,
    "text": "For me,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:20.940",
    "end": "00:07:24.820",
    "start_seconds": 440.94,
    "end_seconds": 444.82,
    "text": "it was my experience in Istanbul, in Turkey,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:24.820",
    "end": "00:07:28.060",
    "start_seconds": 444.82,
    "end_seconds": 448.06,
    "text": "where a cheerful cafe owner took interest in me"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:28.100",
    "end": "00:07:30.980",
    "start_seconds": 448.1,
    "end_seconds": 450.98,
    "text": "and told me the history of Turkish tea,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:31.020",
    "end": "00:07:33.180",
    "start_seconds": 451.02,
    "end_seconds": 453.18,
    "text": "how to make it and how to drink it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:33.780",
    "end": "00:07:38.340",
    "start_seconds": 453.78,
    "end_seconds": 458.34000000000003,
    "text": "Whenever I think about Turkey or Istanbul, my heart fills with joy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:39.420",
    "end": "00:07:42.140",
    "start_seconds": 459.42,
    "end_seconds": 462.14,
    "text": "This is what we crave. This is what we seek."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:44.020",
    "end": "00:07:46.780",
    "start_seconds": 464.02,
    "end_seconds": 466.78,
    "text": "I'm sure some of you have been stranded at airports"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:46.780",
    "end": "00:07:49.140",
    "start_seconds": 466.78,
    "end_seconds": 469.14,
    "text": "because of airline disruptions."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:49.180",
    "end": "00:07:50.660",
    "start_seconds": 469.18,
    "end_seconds": 470.65999999999997,
    "text": "The airline has two options:"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:50.660",
    "end": "00:07:54.780",
    "start_seconds": 470.65999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 474.78,
    "text": "one to check you into [a] hotel overlooking the terminal,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:54.780",
    "end": "00:07:58.060",
    "start_seconds": 474.78,
    "end_seconds": 478.06,
    "text": "or maybe organize a Turkish tea-making workshop."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:58.940",
    "end": "00:08:01.300",
    "start_seconds": 478.94,
    "end_seconds": 481.3,
    "text": "Maybe some of us will like it, and if we like it,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:01.340",
    "end": "00:08:04.020",
    "start_seconds": 481.34,
    "end_seconds": 484.02,
    "text": "we will become a loyal customer of the airline."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:05.500",
    "end": "00:08:07.260",
    "start_seconds": 485.5,
    "end_seconds": 487.26,
    "text": "Same is the case with hotels."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:07.300",
    "end": "00:08:10.460",
    "start_seconds": 487.3,
    "end_seconds": 490.46,
    "text": "If hotels can use technology to give custom concierges,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:11.620",
    "end": "00:08:15.100",
    "start_seconds": 491.62,
    "end_seconds": 495.1,
    "text": "which speaks in your language, curates local suggestions,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:15.140",
    "end": "00:08:16.900",
    "start_seconds": 495.14,
    "end_seconds": 496.9,
    "text": "helps you discover hidden gems,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:18.220",
    "end": "00:08:20.540",
    "start_seconds": 498.22,
    "end_seconds": 500.54,
    "text": "and walks along with you,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:20.580",
    "end": "00:08:25.380",
    "start_seconds": 500.58,
    "end_seconds": 505.38,
    "text": "you will become a loyal customer of the hotel."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:25.420",
    "end": "00:08:27.780",
    "start_seconds": 505.42,
    "end_seconds": 507.78,
    "text": "Imagine the possibilities"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:29.660",
    "end": "00:08:34.860",
    "start_seconds": 509.66,
    "end_seconds": 514.86,
    "text": "of uncovering authentic experiences that give us true joy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:36.380",
    "end": "00:08:38.940",
    "start_seconds": 516.38,
    "end_seconds": 518.94,
    "text": "Many residents in the destinations we love"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:40.340",
    "end": "00:08:42.540",
    "start_seconds": 520.34,
    "end_seconds": 522.54,
    "text": "don’t see the direct benefits of a traveler."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:44.780",
    "end": "00:08:46.900",
    "start_seconds": 524.78,
    "end_seconds": 526.9,
    "text": "They only see the negative side."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:46.900",
    "end": "00:08:50.900",
    "start_seconds": 526.9,
    "end_seconds": 530.9,
    "text": "I know we are contributing to the local economy through our money."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:52.140",
    "end": "00:08:53.460",
    "start_seconds": 532.14,
    "end_seconds": 533.46,
    "text": "But that may not be enough."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:54.660",
    "end": "00:08:59.420",
    "start_seconds": 534.66,
    "end_seconds": 539.42,
    "text": "And even if we want to contribute through our time,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:59.460",
    "end": "00:09:01.020",
    "start_seconds": 539.46,
    "end_seconds": 541.02,
    "text": "we don't know how to do it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:02.420",
    "end": "00:09:05.540",
    "start_seconds": 542.42,
    "end_seconds": 545.54,
    "text": "Residents feel like how I used to feel as a child"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:05.580",
    "end": "00:09:08.820",
    "start_seconds": 545.58,
    "end_seconds": 548.82,
    "text": "when unexpected guests arrived in my house,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:08.820",
    "end": "00:09:12.700",
    "start_seconds": 548.82,
    "end_seconds": 552.7,
    "text": "especially if they didn't carry any special gifts for me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:12.700",
    "end": "00:09:14.940",
    "start_seconds": 552.7,
    "end_seconds": 554.94,
    "text": "I barely uttered a smile"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:14.940",
    "end": "00:09:18.260",
    "start_seconds": 554.94,
    "end_seconds": 558.26,
    "text": "and I wished that they [would] leave as soon as possible."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:18.300",
    "end": "00:09:22.060",
    "start_seconds": 558.3,
    "end_seconds": 562.06,
    "text": "I'm sure many of you, if you could find a way"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:22.100",
    "end": "00:09:24.620",
    "start_seconds": 562.1,
    "end_seconds": 564.62,
    "text": "to contribute through your time, you would."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:25.300",
    "end": "00:09:27.700",
    "start_seconds": 565.3,
    "end_seconds": 567.7,
    "text": "Again things are changing on this front."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:27.700",
    "end": "00:09:30.380",
    "start_seconds": 567.7,
    "end_seconds": 570.38,
    "text": "Golden Volunteer is an example of a platform"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:30.420",
    "end": "00:09:33.820",
    "start_seconds": 570.42,
    "end_seconds": 573.82,
    "text": "which connects volunteers with organizations and projects"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:33.820",
    "end": "00:09:35.180",
    "start_seconds": 573.82,
    "end_seconds": 575.18,
    "text": "looking for volunteers."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:35.940",
    "end": "00:09:39.620",
    "start_seconds": 575.94,
    "end_seconds": 579.62,
    "text": "It, in fact, goes to the extent of doing a volunteer background check."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:39.620",
    "end": "00:09:43.540",
    "start_seconds": 579.62,
    "end_seconds": 583.54,
    "text": "If we can unleash a “gratitude marketplace” at scale,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:45.260",
    "end": "00:09:50.620",
    "start_seconds": 585.26,
    "end_seconds": 590.62,
    "text": "we will create a deep connection between the traveler and the resident."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:50.620",
    "end": "00:09:53.820",
    "start_seconds": 590.62,
    "end_seconds": 593.82,
    "text": "Copenhagen is going on that path with CopenPay."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:53.820",
    "end": "00:09:55.700",
    "start_seconds": 593.82,
    "end_seconds": 595.7,
    "text": "You get points."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:55.700",
    "end": "00:09:58.940",
    "start_seconds": 595.7,
    "end_seconds": 598.94,
    "text": "If you do gardening, you get points. If you do cycling,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:58.940",
    "end": "00:10:02.580",
    "start_seconds": 598.94,
    "end_seconds": 602.58,
    "text": "you can use those points for redeeming [at] attractions."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:03.620",
    "end": "00:10:08.100",
    "start_seconds": 603.62,
    "end_seconds": 608.1,
    "text": "If you had the opportunity to contribute with your time,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:08.140",
    "end": "00:10:09.500",
    "start_seconds": 608.14,
    "end_seconds": 609.5,
    "text": "what would you do?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:09.540",
    "end": "00:10:11.260",
    "start_seconds": 609.54,
    "end_seconds": 611.26,
    "text": "Some of you are animal lovers."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:12.500",
    "end": "00:10:16.740",
    "start_seconds": 612.5,
    "end_seconds": 616.74,
    "text": "You may want to be part of the elephant rescue centers in Thailand,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:16.740",
    "end": "00:10:20.660",
    "start_seconds": 616.74,
    "end_seconds": 620.66,
    "text": "or want to be part of sea turtle rescue centers in India."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:21.740",
    "end": "00:10:24.300",
    "start_seconds": 621.74,
    "end_seconds": 624.3,
    "text": "If you're an environment or nature lover,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:24.340",
    "end": "00:10:26.700",
    "start_seconds": 624.34,
    "end_seconds": 626.7,
    "text": "you may want to be part of coral reef preservation"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:26.700",
    "end": "00:10:29.420",
    "start_seconds": 626.7,
    "end_seconds": 629.42,
    "text": "in the Great Barrier or in Maldives."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:29.460",
    "end": "00:10:31.500",
    "start_seconds": 629.46,
    "end_seconds": 631.5,
    "text": "And if you are a history lover like me,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:33.140",
    "end": "00:10:36.980",
    "start_seconds": 633.14,
    "end_seconds": 636.98,
    "text": "you may be wanting to be a part of restoration"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:37.020",
    "end": "00:10:39.100",
    "start_seconds": 637.02,
    "end_seconds": 639.1,
    "text": "of an 800-year-old temple like this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:40.100",
    "end": "00:10:44.140",
    "start_seconds": 640.1,
    "end_seconds": 644.14,
    "text": "In fact, I will seek such an opportunity and bake it in my itinerary"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:44.180",
    "end": "00:10:47.660",
    "start_seconds": 644.18,
    "end_seconds": 647.66,
    "text": "because I will love to be part of something like this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:47.660",
    "end": "00:10:49.460",
    "start_seconds": 647.66,
    "end_seconds": 649.46,
    "text": "The possibilities are infinite."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:51.140",
    "end": "00:10:52.940",
    "start_seconds": 651.14,
    "end_seconds": 652.94,
    "text": "The travel industry is going to grow."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:54.540",
    "end": "00:10:59.780",
    "start_seconds": 654.54,
    "end_seconds": 659.78,
    "text": "It's one industry that is probably encouraging tolerance"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:59.780",
    "end": "00:11:01.420",
    "start_seconds": 659.78,
    "end_seconds": 661.42,
    "text": "in this highly polarized world."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:02.900",
    "end": "00:11:04.180",
    "start_seconds": 662.9,
    "end_seconds": 664.18,
    "text": "It's for us"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:06.060",
    "end": "00:11:10.860",
    "start_seconds": 666.06,
    "end_seconds": 670.86,
    "text": "to shape positively the destinations we love"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:10.860",
    "end": "00:11:13.460",
    "start_seconds": 670.86,
    "end_seconds": 673.46,
    "text": "and the people who call it their home."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:15.100",
    "end": "00:11:19.300",
    "start_seconds": 675.1,
    "end_seconds": 679.3,
    "text": "I've talked about the tools at hand, and I've given you a few examples."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:19.340",
    "end": "00:11:22.780",
    "start_seconds": 679.34,
    "end_seconds": 682.78,
    "text": "I want to leave with one question."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:22.780",
    "end": "00:11:28.700",
    "start_seconds": 682.78,
    "end_seconds": 688.7,
    "text": "On your next trip, will you be a tourist or a joyful guest?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:28.700",
    "end": "00:11:32.900",
    "start_seconds": 688.7,
    "end_seconds": 692.9,
    "text": "It's time we bring joy back in travel."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:32.900",
    "end": "00:11:34.180",
    "start_seconds": 692.9,
    "end_seconds": 694.18,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:34.220",
    "end": "00:11:36.460",
    "start_seconds": 694.22,
    "end_seconds": 696.46,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  }
]
